OL,5,G1300 Reuben Owen: Life in The Dales
OL,6,     FIt's Christmas, so Reuben and
OL,7,     FTommy are picking a giant tree for
OL,8,     Fthe local town, but the pressure
OL,9,     Fis on to deliver it for the big
OL,10,     Fday. And team test drive a new
OL,11,     F4x4.
OL,12,G1405 Reuben Owen: Life in The Dales
OL,13,     FReuben sets about renovating a
OL,14,     F200-year-old tumble-down cottage,
OL,15,     Fand discovers an old well in the
OL,16,     Fprocess. He also helps new
OL,17,     Fgirlfriend Jess round up her flock
OL,18,     Fat her family farm.
